(OUT/'section.html').write_text('<section id="flask-binding"><p class="eyebrow">Water follow-up · arbitrary assignments</p><h2>Does all-input removal break flask retrieval?</h2><p>Eight native and gate-off answers are correct after swapping water/oil assignments and fact order. Every case removes an active input water contribution. Separate Waterloo observations expose the effect of tokenization and shared causal prefixes.</p><p><a href="../2026-11-12-flask-binding/">Prompts, heatmaps, paired responses and word-piece observations →</a></p></section>\n')
